[00:00.54] And if I'm wasting my time
[00:05.66] Then nothing could be better than hanging on the line
[00:17.68] And waiting for an honest word forever
[00:24.52] And if you're saying goodbye
[00:57.32] Please don't you think me bitter for recalling every rhyme
[01:09.32] From the book, the page, the line, the word, the letter
[01:16.32] Well, the window's turning blue, and the water's ever flowing
[01:55.42] And I hope I'm not a fool for laughing at myself as you are going
